{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/41/k5bcrq0rfws7z4ry62bxla6bfm8eivy.mp3","text":"怀疑我不在你面前？拜托，双子分身可不会说话。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/24cxi5r7rdx2wfyw3gqxscxveuia6f4.mp3","text":"对我来说，一心多用从来都不是难事。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/rwdh9x0cuz7gnho1hu5w7vewwr9o3wg.mp3","text":"多花些心思在情报上，有的仗可以打得更轻松。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/9wutv1iu3hd9fujqpmc1f71ddq0upun.mp3","text":"最好处理一下你热水壶底的水垢，不然咖啡的味道好不了。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/81/adxduzq2v23rlit0umieixqatkxg95f.mp3","text":"亲眼所见并不一定可靠，借助设备才能发现隐藏的真相。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/4rrd7sk9envncyydnf1i9pud1282awi.mp3","text":"异于常人的外表的确给我制造了一些困难，但也仅仅是“一些困难”而已。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/jqyjo9sy0x3dmbnkouqyq3p4x6z82j5.mp3","text":"我听从你的指挥。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/66/2h97yfay5rztlfrlk47x85eqejywwl6.mp3","text":"我信任你的判断。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/68/f4y5xvpu35j9450o3jgkw1g17vymtj8.mp3","text":"我想我正在一场难忘的旅途之中，不知道最终会带什么样的纪念品回家。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/kskfuwucdngdysxskwug1cmr3adzgex.mp3","text":"稍等，我马上回来。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/7zwjxkcdzdzyk62vw02mxu096dqnw71.mp3","text":"彩虹小队成员，代号双月。我想我们有很多信息可以相互分享。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/b3maqi69ggisuuvgvddispncos0f8i2.mp3","text":"考虑过把录像做成三维的吗？","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/jg5ja0aanwqxqhv11zgxr8c50ci312c.mp3","text":"晋升？我可以访问更高权限的资料库了吗？","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/gegbmtpzzd4omoxn59sdke0f2k1rys9.mp3","text":"借此机会，我希望能踏足更多尚未探索过的角落。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/rt0ca4qmmr23416hwp8cmdz7gnz4uor.mp3","text":"友情提示，我的全息投影可挡不住子弹。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/2fzekzs699pzwldsrzdgpzleic6u5r7.mp3","text":"双子分身会指引方向。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/oo3aullkikt3uh1pj1soslaop1qg654.mp3","text":"怒斥光明的消逝。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/8qxdbx59hlw96zsx0gx7f5y5h3wnly1.mp3","text":"发现目标。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/5shv8j6avv7yozf6heaiczi7xti1jkv.mp3","text":"我准备好了，你呢？","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/94/1nlki8wfpmvjtc45mcy4tgcj5zmglle.mp3","text":"正在收集情报。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/l3p8x95osyjakq4gnz2oz38bt1ejd93.mp3","text":"掩护我。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/cum4yogddn48rlka4zlilc6bna744cz.mp3","text":"麦克风测试正常。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/i6z92imruuolftqe5qxu9cpewpkqk6f.mp3","text":"注意隐蔽！","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/212pxmaou3u1mc7v4gujlwozf6bjdoq.mp3","text":"跟紧我！","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/67/eie9wi5mbtjgkmbvmpahiwlnvijqj34.mp3","text":"重新部署。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/l4rmvdp5yaz2sgskqbb9d40r0bmswlg.mp3","text":"敌人进入视野！","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/5svbp4novuiupsztwrtr5srkye5dfwt.mp3","text":"如果知晓如何连接，所有系统都能互相补足。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/a4pgqlskrjh7dtldvee1n2kvgwex37d.mp3","text":"就该是这样。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/lp6daginao3gi62jxe5hbj0xni1hxu7.mp3","text":"你的斗志仍然旺盛，给他们看看你真正的能耐。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/tckyrtkv4ue8iluvnnschbylyljnjlb.mp3","text":"你的故事不会在这里结束。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/eivf7lou18z1ran04v99ej8q51v7vfe.mp3","text":"如果你非要这样的话。","alt":"voice/char_4124_iana/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/tddn20jv0jhg5jwz0bmo4elxv1wfur6.mp3","te